# Source: https://genome.ucsc.edu/FAQ/FAQformat.html#format1
# Symptom: file contains # comment lines interspersed with data; spec allows # for comments;
# parsers that treat # as invalid chrom name will fail
# This is a comment line
chr1	1000	2000	featureA	0	+
# Another comment
chr1	3000	4000	featureB	0	-
chr2	5000	6000	featureC	100	.
